        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 01-F2, Keyed Entry Traditional Half-Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe perfect medium between old and new styles, Fusion Hardware's Keyed Entry Half-Round Knob and Traditional Cambridge Rose Set will be at home amidst almost any decor. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and lifetime polished brass finishes. Made out of solid brass, it will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 01-F2 Grade 1 Grade 1 Half Round Knob and Cambridge Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Levers are field reversible</li>\r\n<li>Bump and pick resistant lock cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Certified ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway & pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Keyed Door Knob Fusion 01  F2:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway</li>\r\n<li>Includes 2 homeowner keys.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <B>Single Cylinder</b> Keyed Entry Knob is operated by a key on the outside and a push-button on the inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
