                "description": "Keyed Entry Half-Round Knob Fusion K-01-F2 - The perfect medium between old and new styles, Fusion Hardware's Keyed Entry Half-Round Knob and Traditional Cambridge Rose Set will be at home amidst almost any decor. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and lifetime polished brass finishes. Made out of solid brass, it will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
